        "quote": "R304.4 Height effect on room area. Portions of a room with a sloping ceiling measuring less than 5 feet (1524 mm) or a furred ceiling measuring less than 7 feet (2135 mm) from the finished floor to the finished ceiling shall not be considered as contributing to the minimum required habitable area for that room.",
